The files in gradient-engine/ are the gradient engine from gradients.sh, installed from its
shadcn registry (https://gradients.sh/r/gradient-engine.json) together with the Mercury
preset (https://gradients.sh/r/c/kX8nN9Jqdy.json). gradients.sh releases its free components,
presets and the gradient engine under the MIT license (https://gradients.sh/license).
shaders/common.ts also contains simplex noise by Ian McEwan, Stefan Gustavson and Ashima Arts (MIT).

Changes made for Nara: gradient-engine/mount.ts gains setPaused() (marked "Nara addition") so the
landing page's pause button can hold the frame still. Everything else is as served by the registry.

